    "Prism checks IPv4 and IPv6 independently. Location lookup prefers IPv4 and uses IPv6 when IPv4 is unavailable." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prism 会分别检测 IPv4 和 IPv6。位置查询优先使用 IPv4；IPv4 不可用时使用 IPv6。"}}}},
